            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He was still speaking, when lo, a bright cloud overshadowed them, and a voice from the cloud said, “This is my beloved Son,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "my Son, my",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "(or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ")",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beloved",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with whom I am well pleased; listen to him.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the disciples heard this, they fell on their faces, and were filled with awe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jesus came and touched them, saying, “Rise, and have no fear.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when they lifted up their eyes, they saw no one but Jesus only.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
